			(property "Description" "WE-DD SMD Shielded Coupled Inductor\n\nCharacteristics\n\n1:1 transformer\n\nDouble inductor with two identical windings\n\n4 different sizes available\n\nOperating temperature: –40 ºC to +125 ºC\n\nRecommended solder profile: Reflow\n\nCustom designs on request\n\nApplications\n\nFor SEPIC and CUK topologies\n\nFlyback applications\n\nSwitching regulators with second, unregulated output voltages\n\nhttp://katalog.we-online.de/media/images/v2/Family_WE-DD.jpg\n\nDetails see: http://katalog.we-online.de/en/pbs/WE-DD http://katalog.we-online.de/en/pbs/WE-DD\n\nUpdated by  Dan Xu 2014-06-10\n2014 (C) Wurth Elektronik"
