			(property "Description" "SMD Shielded Tiny Power Inductor\n\nCharacteristics\n\nTiny Power Inductor design\n\n1.7 times more current in comparison with unshielded versions\n\nRobust design & high durability\n\nLow RDC\n\nMagnetically shielded with magnetic glue reducing buzz noise in ultra-low levels\n\nOperating Temperature: –40 °C to +125 °C\n\nApplications\n\nIntegrated DC/DC Converters\n\nSwitching controllers which required high efficiency\n\nPortable power (Smartphones, digital cameras, Tablets, etc.)\n\nEmbedded laptops and PCs\n\nBig sizes (5040, 60xx, 8040) used for shock-proof circuits\n\nhttp://katalog.we-online.de/media/images/v2/Family_WE-LQS.jpg\n\nDetails see: http://katalog.we-online.de/en/pbs/WE-LQS http://katalog.we-online.de/en/pbs/WE-LQS\n\nCreated  by  Dan Xu 2014-05-21\n2014 (C) Wurth Elektronik"
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
				(hide yes)
